         "step": 1,
         "text": "The series is geometric with common ratio \\( r = \\frac{2}{5} \\), and \\( |r| < 1 \\), so it converges. Its first term is the term with \\( n = 2 \\): \\( a = \\frac{24}{25} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
