         ],
         "rule_named": "first term and ratio"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The sum is \\( \\frac{a}{1 - r} = \\frac{\\frac{24}{25}}{1 - \\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right)} = \\frac{8}{5} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
